# Tests that take far longer than the others under the race detector (about
# 25 s each, or several seconds). scripts/test-shards.sh deals them out one
# shard after another before it splits the rest by hash. A name that is not a
# test any more is ignored, and the list is not needed for correctness: only
# to keep the shards even.
TestMCPPageGetWithALargeHeader
TestMCPTooLarge
TestMemberRoutesAreNotForOtherPeopleSpaces
TestMCPCreate
